       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LETTERFREQHISTOGRAM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ALPHABET-STRING PIC X(26) VALUE "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ".
       01 ALPHABET-TABLE REDEFINES ALPHABET-STRING.
           05 ALPHABET-LETTER PIC X OCCURS 26 TIMES.
       01 SOURCE-TEXT PIC X(11) VALUE "MISSISSIPPI".
       01 LETTER-COUNTS.
           05 LETTER-COUNT PIC 9(2) OCCURS 26 TIMES VALUE 0.
       01 CHAR-INDEX PIC 9(2).
       01 CURRENT-CHAR PIC X.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 K PIC 9(2).
       01 LETTER-POS PIC 9(2).
       01 BAR-LEN PIC 9(2).
       01 BAR PIC X(20) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING CHAR-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL CHAR-INDEX > 11
               MOVE SOURCE-TEXT(CHAR-INDEX:1) TO CURRENT-CHAR
               MOVE 0 TO LETTER-POS
               PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 26
                   IF ALPHABET-LETTER(I) = CURRENT-CHAR
                       MOVE I TO LETTER-POS
                   END-IF
               END-PERFORM
               IF LETTER-POS > 0
                   ADD 1 TO LETTER-COUNT(LETTER-POS)
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM

           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 26
               IF LETTER-COUNT(I) > 0
                   MOVE SPACES TO BAR
                   MOVE LETTER-COUNT(I) TO BAR-LEN
                   PERFORM VARYING K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL K > BAR-LEN
                       MOVE "*" TO BAR(K:1)
                   END-PERFORM
                   DISPLAY ALPHABET-LETTER(I) ": " BAR
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
